// A sibling file in the same directory as main.weave — no
// package(...) needed to reach it from there (weave_spec.md §17.1).
// Capitalization has no special meaning here (unlike a package(...)
// import, §17.2): every top-level binding in the same directory is
// equally visible to every other file in it.
greet = fn(name) {
	return "hello, " + name
}
